{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_006.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Kawakami and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Kids these days are so aggressive.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Like how they're totally okay with[n]kissing in public while still wearing[n]their uniforms...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Wouldn't it shock you if you saw[n]something like that?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Do you envy them?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I think nothing of it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're all I was looking at.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Stop it...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "...Really?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "What's with the lip service?[n]Are you trying to get a discount?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Well, we made it through the busiest time[n]of the year; now we can finally relax a bit.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll allow it.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's have fun.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Merry Christmas.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Thank you sooo much! [clr 2][f 1 9 0][clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Mhm!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Oh... Merry Christmas.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_011_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Kawakami[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_011_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "...Oh yeah!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Here's your present.[n]Thanks for everything.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Thank you.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll cherish it.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "You're welcome.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "So, um...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "I'm happy that I get to spend time[n]with you like this, you know?[n]Given I thought you were dead...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "But I know that this isn't normal...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Does it bother you that I worry...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Kawakami stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_1_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "Hm? What's wrong...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_1_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "*sigh* ...Hey, are you okay...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "I see...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "So it is a bother...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "I think I'll go...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "It's fine. I wouldn't want to bother you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "I'll be okay.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "You do know I could tell that something[n]was wrong from the look on your face,[n]don't you...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kawakami",
   "en": "...Good night.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Kawakami worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_023_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}